==English==

===Etymology===
* From {{etyl|la}} {{term|condono|condōno|lang=la|forgive}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|condon|es}}

# {{transitive}} To [[forgive]], [[excuse]] or [[overlook]] (something).
# {{transitive}} To [[allow]], [[accept]] or [[permit]] (something).
# {{transitive|legal}} To forgive (marital [[infidelity]] or other marital offense).

